# The legacy CMS clients run in Edge IE mode: CMS Classic at document mode 5 (old
# JScript), CMS Modern and DCF at mode 11. Prettier's default trailingComma: "all"
# adds trailing commas to object literals and call argument lists, which both
# engines reject outright -- "SCRIPT1028: Expected identifier, string or number" --
# so the whole file fails to parse and silently never runs. Keep every hand-written
# source for those engines out of Prettier.
#
# These paths moved from infra/proxy/config/global-components.cms-auth-v2/ into
# packages/cps-global-presence/ on 2026-09-07. The old entries were left pointing
# at the old location, so for a while NOTHING here was protected; build.sh's
# check-syntax floor is what caught it, when the cms-augmentation placeholders were
# formatted on save. If this package moves again, move these with it.
packages/cps-global-presence/common/
packages/cps-global-presence/legacy-apps/
packages/cps-global-presence/cms-augmentation-placeholders/
